---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Link With Us | Partner With Sarkari Sahayak — Get Free Backlinks"
  description="Partner with Sarkari Sahayak — India's #1 Hindi Govt Job Portal. Exchange backlinks, guest posts, and grow together. DA 30+ site. Free link exchange for education & job portals."
  canonical="/link-with-us"
  keywords="link exchange, backlink exchange india, guest post sarkari, partner with govt job site, seo link building india, education site link exchange"
>

<style>
  .lw-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #000 0%, #0d1b2a 60%, #0a0a0a 100%);
    padding: 80px 0 60px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .lw-hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -200px; left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 900px; height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(28,105,212,.18), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .lw-hero-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .lw-badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,107,53,.45); background: rgba(255,107,53,.07);
    color: var(--saffron); padding: 9px 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .lw-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 62px;
    line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .lw-title span { color: var(--saffron); }
  .lw-sub { font-size: 18px; color: var(--body); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 32px; }

  .stats-band {
    display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline); background: var(--panel);
    max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .sband-item {
    flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: 20px 16px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  .sband-item:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .sband-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 36px;
    color: var(--saffron); line-height: 1;
  }
  .sband-label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }

  .lw-main { padding: 80px 0; }

  .lw-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px; margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .lw-card {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    padding: 32px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .lw-card::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 4px; background: var(--m-gradient);
  }
  .lw-card-icon { font-size: 42px; margin-bottom: 16px; display: block; }
  .lw-card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .lw-card-desc { font-size: 15px; color: var(--body); line-height: 1.7; }
  .lw-card-tag {
    display: inline-flex; margin-top: 16px; padding: 5px 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;
    background: rgba(255,107,53,.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255,107,53,.35);
    color: var(--saffron);
  }

  .section-title-sm {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 32px;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .section-sub-sm { font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 40px; }

  /* Site Info Box */
  .site-info-box {
    background: var(--elevated); border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 64px;
  }
  .si-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 0; }
  .si-item {
    text-align: center; padding: 20px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  .si-item:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .si-val {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--white); line-height: 1;
  }
  .si-val em { font-style: normal; color: var(--saffron); }
  .si-key { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }

  /* Requirements List */
  .req-list { list-style: none; }
  .req-list li {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px; border: 1px solid var(--hairline-strong);
    margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--body);
    background: var(--card);
  }
  .req-list li .ri { color: var(--saffron); font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .req-list li .rt { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; display: block; margin-top: 2px; }

  /* Contact Form */
  .lw-form-wrap {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    padding: 40px; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .form-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .form-sub { font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .lw-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  .form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .form-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .form-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted);
  }
  .form-input, .form-select, .form-textarea {
    height: 46px; padding: 0 14px;
    background: var(--soft); border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    color: var(--white); font-family: var(--font-hindi);
    font-size: 15px; width: 100%; transition: border-color .25s;
  }
  .form-textarea { height: 120px; padding: 14px; resize: vertical; }
  .form-input:focus, .form-select:focus, .form-textarea:focus {
    border-color: var(--saffron); outline: none;
  }
  .form-select { cursor: pointer; }
  .form-submit {
    height: 50px; padding: 0 32px;
    background: var(--saffron); color: #000;
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
    border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: background .25s;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; align-self: flex-start;
  }
  .form-submit:hover { background: var(--gold); }

  /* Email alternative */
  .email-alt {
    text-align: center; margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  .email-alt p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .email-link {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--saffron); letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,107,53,.4);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }

  /* Templates section */
  .template-box {
    background: var(--soft); border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 20px; position: relative;
  }
  .template-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--saffron);
    margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  }
  .template-label::before {
    content: ''; width: 20px; height: 2px; background: var(--saffron);
  }
  .template-text {
    font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--body);
    white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: monospace;
    background: var(--canvas); padding: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--hairline-strong);
  }
  .copy-btn {
    position: absolute; top: 16px; right: 16px;
    padding: 6px 14px; background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline); color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer; transition: .25s;
  }
  .copy-btn:hover { border-color: var(--saffron); color: var(--saffron); }
  .copy-btn.copied { border-color: var(--success); color: var(--success); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .lw-title { font-size: 38px; }
    .lw-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .si-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .si-item:nth-child(2) { border-right: none; }
    .si-item:nth-child(1), .si-item:nth-child(2) {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    }
    .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .lw-form-wrap { padding: 24px; }
    .stats-band { flex-direction: column; }
    .sband-item { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
    .sband-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  }
</style>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="lw-hero">
  <div class="container lw-hero-inner">
    <div class="lw-badge">🤝 Partnership Program</div>
    <h1 class="lw-title">Link With <span>Us</span></h1>
    <p class="lw-sub">
      Sarkari Sahayak ke saath partner karein — India ka #1 Hindi Govt Job Portal.
      Free link exchange, guest posts, aur mutual growth.
    </p>

    <div class="stats-band">
      <div class="sband-item">
        <div class="sband-num">50K+</div>
        <div class="sband-label">Monthly Visitors</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sband-item">
        <div class="sband-num">DA 30+</div>
        <div class="sband-label">Domain Authority</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sband-item">
        <div class="sband-num">2,000+</div>
        <div class="sband-label">Indexed Pages</div>
      </div>
      <div class="sband-item">
        <div class="sband-num">100%</div>
        <div class="sband-label">Niche Relevant</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MAIN -->
<main class="lw-main">
  <div class="container">

    <!-- Site Stats -->
    <div class="site-info-box">
      <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--saffron);margin-bottom:20px;">
        📊 Hamaari Site Ki Details
      </p>
      <div class="si-grid">
        <div class="si-item">
          <div class="si-val">govtjob<em>.</em>salarypitcher<em>.</em>com</div>
          <div class="si-key">Website URL</div>
        </div>
        <div class="si-item">
          <div class="si-val">Govt Jobs <em>/</em> Education</div>
          <div class="si-key">Niche</div>
        </div>
        <div class="si-item">
          <div class="si-val">Hindi <em>+</em> English</div>
          <div class="si-key">Language</div>
        </div>
        <div class="si-item">
          <div class="si-val">India <em>(</em>National<em>)</em></div>
          <div class="si-key">Audience</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Partnership Types -->
    <h2 class="section-title-sm">Partnership Options</h2>
    <p class="section-sub-sm">Aap in 4 tareekon se hamare saath partner kar sakte hain</p>

    <div class="lw-grid">
      <div class="lw-card">
        <span class="lw-card-icon">🔗</span>
        <div class="lw-card-title">Link Exchange</div>
        <p class="lw-card-desc">
          Aap hamaari site ko apni relevant page pe link karein, hum aapki site ko apni
          relevant page pe link karenge. Dono ko genuine DoFollow backlink milega.
        </p>
        <span class="lw-card-tag">✅ Free | DoFollow | Permanent</span>
      </div>

      <div class="lw-card">
        <span class="lw-card-icon">✍️</span>
        <div class="lw-card-title">Guest Post</div>
        <p class="lw-card-desc">
          Aap hamaari site pe quality article likhein — Sarkari jobs, exams, career advice
          ke baare mein. Article mein 1-2 do-follow links apni site ke hoge.
        </p>
        <span class="lw-card-tag">✅ Free | Author Bio Link | Permanent</span>
      </div>

      <div class="lw-card">
        <span class="lw-card-icon">📰</span>
        <div class="lw-card-title">Resource Mention</div>
        <p class="lw-card-desc">
          Hamaari kisi bhi page pe aapki site ko ek useful resource ke roop mein mention
          karwaaein. Contextual link milega relevant content mein.
        </p>
        <span class="lw-card-tag">✅ Free | Contextual Link | Niche Relevant</span>
      </div>

      <div class="lw-card">
        <span class="lw-card-icon">📣</span>
        <div class="lw-card-title">Social Shoutout</div>
        <p class="lw-card-desc">
          Aapki site ya content ko hamare Telegram channel aur social media pe share
          karenge. Brand awareness + referral traffic milega.
        </p>
        <span class="lw-card-tag">✅ Free | Telegram | Social Media</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Requirements -->
    <h2 class="section-title-sm">Eligibility Requirements</h2>
    <p class="section-sub-sm">Hum sirf genuine sites ke saath partner karte hain</p>
    <ul class="req-list" style="margin-bottom:64px;">
      <li>
        <span class="ri">✅</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Education / Govt Job Niche</strong>
          <span class="rt">Sarkari naukri, exams, coaching, yojana, result — in topics se related site honi chahiye</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="ri">✅</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Original Content</strong>
          <span class="rt">Copied ya spun content wali sites accept nahi ki jaayengi</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="ri">✅</span>
        <div>
          <strong>No Adult / Gambling Content</strong>
          <span class="rt">Site pe koi objectionable content nahi hona chahiye</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="ri">✅</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Minimum 10 Published Pages</strong>
          <span class="rt">Nai sites consider nahi ki jaati. Kam se kam 10 quality pages chahiye</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="ri">✅</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Google Indexed</strong>
          <span class="rt">Site Google mein indexed honi chahiye — verify: site:yourwebsite.com</span>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <!-- Contact Form -->
    <div class="lw-form-wrap">
      <div class="form-title">📨 Apply for Partnership</div>
      <p class="form-sub">Form fill karein — 24-48 ghante mein reply milega</p>

      <form class="lw-form" id="lwForm" novalidate>
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-field">
            <label class="form-label" for="lw-name">Aapka Naam *</label>
            <input class="form-input" id="lw-name" type="text" placeholder="Ramesh Kumar" required>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label class="form-label" for="lw-email">Email Address *</label>
            <input class="form-input" id="lw-email" type="email" placeholder="you@yoursite.com" required>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-field">
          <label class="form-label" for="lw-url">Aapki Website URL *</label>
          <input class="form-input" id="lw-url" type="url" placeholder="https://yourwebsite.com" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-field">
            <label class="form-label" for="lw-type">Partnership Type *</label>
            <select class="form-select" id="lw-type" required>
              <option value="">-- Select --</option>
              <option value="link-exchange">🔗 Link Exchange</option>
              <option value="guest-post">✍️ Guest Post (Hum likhenge)</option>
              <option value="guest-post-you">✍️ Guest Post (Aap likhenge)</option>
              <option value="resource">📰 Resource Mention</option>
              <option value="shoutout">📣 Social Shoutout</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label class="form-label" for="lw-niche">Site Niche</label>
            <select class="form-select" id="lw-niche">
              <option value="">-- Select --</option>
              <option value="govt-jobs">Govt Jobs / Sarkari Naukri</option>
              <option value="education">Education / Coaching</option>
              <option value="current-affairs">Current Affairs / GK</option>
              <option value="result">Exam Results / Answer Keys</option>
              <option value="yojana">Govt Schemes / Yojana</option>
              <option value="other">Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-field">
          <label class="form-label" for="lw-msg">Message (Optional)</label>
          <textarea class="form-textarea" id="lw-msg" placeholder="Aapki site ke baare mein thodi information, ya specifically kya chahte hain link exchange mein..."></textarea>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="form-submit" id="lwSubmitBtn">
          🚀 Send Partnership Request
        </button>
      </form>

      <div class="email-alt">
        <p>Ya directly email karein:</p>
        <a class="email-link" href="mailto:contact@salarypitcher.com">
          📧 contact@salarypitcher.com
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Outreach Email Templates -->
    <div style="margin-top:80px;">
      <h2 class="section-title-sm">📋 Ready-Made Outreach Email Templates</h2>
      <p class="section-sub-sm">Doosri sites ko link request karne ke liye in templates ko copy karein aur bhejein</p>

      <div class="template-box">
        <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyTemplate(this, 'tpl1')">Copy</button>
        <div class="template-label">Template 1 — Link Exchange Request (Hindi)</div>
        <pre class="template-text" id="tpl1">Subject: Link Exchange Request — Sarkari Job Portal

Namaste [Site Owner Name],

Main Sarkari Sahayak (govtjob.salarypitcher.com) ka founder hoon.
Hamari site India mein latest govt jobs, results, admit cards
aur sarkari yojana ke baare mein Hindi mein content provide karti hai.

Mujhe aapki site [URL] bahut helpful lagi — hamare audience ke
liye relevant hai. Main aapke saath ek simple link exchange
karna chahta hoon:

✅ Aap hamare relevant page ko link karein
✅ Hum aapke relevant page ko link karenge
✅ Dono ko genuine backlink milega

Kya aap interested hain? Koi charge nahi hai — pure mutual benefit.

Reply karein aur hum details sort kar lete hain.

Dhanyawad,
[Aapka Naam]
govtjob.salarypitcher.com</pre>
      </div>

      <div class="template-box">
        <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyTemplate(this, 'tpl2')">Copy</button>
        <div class="template-label">Template 2 — Guest Post Pitch (English)</div>
        <pre class="template-text" id="tpl2">Subject: Guest Post Collaboration — Govt Jobs Niche

Hi [Name],

I'm reaching out from Sarkari Sahayak (govtjob.salarypitcher.com),
India's leading Hindi government job portal with 50,000+ monthly visitors.

I'd love to contribute a high-quality guest post to your site on
topics like:
• Latest SSC/UPSC/IBPS exam updates
• How to prepare for govt job exams
• State government job opportunities
• Sarkari Yojana benefits guide

In return, I'd appreciate a do-follow backlink in the author bio
or within the content.

Would you be open to this collaboration? I can share 3 topic
ideas for your approval before writing.

Best regards,
[Your Name]
govtjob.salarypitcher.com</pre>
      </div>

      <div class="template-box">
        <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyTemplate(this, 'tpl3')">Copy</button>
        <div class="template-label">Template 3 — Resource Page Link Request</div>
        <pre class="template-text" id="tpl3">Subject: Resource Suggestion for Your [Page Name] Page

Hi [Name],

I came across your resource page at [their URL] and noticed
you link to helpful government job websites.

I'd like to suggest adding Sarkari Sahayak:
🔗 https://govtjob.salarypitcher.com

What we offer:
• 2,000+ latest govt job listings (daily updated)
• Free exam calendar, age calculator, salary calculator
• Answer keys, results & admit cards in Hindi
• 100% free, no login required

It could be a great addition to your resource page for
visitors looking for genuine govt job information in Hindi.

Thank you for considering!

[Your Name]</pre>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</main>

<script is:inline>
function copyTemplate(btn, id) {
  const text = document.getElementById(id).innerText;
  navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {
    btn.textContent = '✓ Copied!';
    btn.classList.add('copied');
    setTimeout(() => {
      btn.textContent = 'Copy';
      btn.classList.remove('copied');
    }, 2500);
  });
}

document.getElementById('lwForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
  e.preventDefault();
  const name = document.getElementById('lw-name').value.trim();
  const email = document.getElementById('lw-email').value.trim();
  const url = document.getElementById('lw-url').value.trim();
  const type = document.getElementById('lw-type').value;

  if (!name || !email || !url || !type) {
    alert('Please fill all required fields (*)');
    return;
  }

  const btn = document.getElementById('lwSubmitBtn');
  const subject = encodeURIComponent('Partnership Request — ' + type + ' from ' + url);
  const body = encodeURIComponent(
    'Name: ' + name + '\n' +
    'Email: ' + email + '\n' +
    'Website: ' + url + '\n' +
    'Type: ' + type + '\n' +
    'Niche: ' + (document.getElementById('lw-niche').value || 'Not specified') + '\n\n' +
    'Message:\n' + (document.getElementById('lw-msg').value || 'No message')
  );
  window.location.href = 'mailto:contact@salarypitcher.com?subject=' + subject + '&body=' + body;
  btn.textContent = '✅ Opening Email...';
  setTimeout(() => { btn.textContent = '🚀 Send Partnership Request'; }, 3000);
});
</script>

</BaseLayout>
